### Requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
### Click "Send Request" above each ### block, top to bottom.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register (once)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "me@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe-12345",
  "displayName": "Me"
}

### 2. Login (stores the token for the requests below)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "me@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe-12345"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 3. Create a collection
# @name createCollection
POST {{host}}/api/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "HR policies",
  "description": "Handbook and policy documents"
}

###
@collectionId = {{createCollection.response.body.$.id}}

### 4. Upload a document (samples/company-handbook.txt)
# @name upload
POST {{host}}/api/collections/{{collectionId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----KnowledgeBoundary

------KnowledgeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="company-handbook.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./samples/company-handbook.txt
------KnowledgeBoundary--

###
@documentId = {{upload.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Check indexing status (wait until "status": "READY")
GET {{host}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. List documents in the collection
GET {{host}}/api/collections/{{collectionId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Ask a question (searches only this collection)
POST {{host}}/api/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How many days of annual leave do I get, and can I carry any over?",
  "collectionId": {{collectionId}}
}

### 8. Ask across all of your collections
POST {{host}}/api/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the remote work policy?"
}

### 9. Delete the document
DELETE {{host}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health check (no auth)
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
